# Only used when the build context is `dashboard/` itself
# (`docker build -f Dockerfile dashboard`). The documented build uses
# `license_manager/` as the context, where `../.dockerignore` applies instead.
#
# These patterns are relative to this directory, which is why the parent ignore
# file needs `dashboard/` prefixes for the very same paths.

